    <system:String x:Key="Connectors.Provider.Description.Audio.Edge">Free online speech through the locally installed edge-tts command; no API key is required.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Connectors.Provider.Description.Audio.OpenAI">OpenAI Speech API with configurable model and preset voice.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Connectors.Provider.Description.Audio.xAI">xAI’s dedicated TTS endpoint with voice, language, and speed settings.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Connectors.Provider.Description.Audio.ElevenLabs">ElevenLabs text-to-speech; enter a Voice ID rather than its display name.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Connectors.Provider.Description.Audio.Mistral">Mistral Voxtral speech using a Voxtral model and Voice ID.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Connectors.Provider.Description.Audio.Gemini">Gemini audio output through generateContent with a preset voice.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Connectors.Provider.Description.Audio.KittenTTS">Local CPU speech requiring Python, kitten-tts, and soundfile.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Connectors.Provider.Description.Audio.Piper">Fully local Piper speech requiring the executable and a matching .onnx model.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Connectors.Provider.Description.Audio.DeepInfra">DeepInfra’s OpenAI-compatible speech endpoint.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Connectors.Provider.Description.Image.DeepInfra">DeepInfra’s OpenAI-compatible image endpoint.</system:String>
