    <system:String x:Key="Config.BrowserStructuredOutputModeHint">Auto: ask the model for a JSON object, downgrading automatically if the backend rejects it. JsonObject: force it (errors if unsupported). PromptOnly: rely on prompt wording only, compatible with any backend.</system:String>
